			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230010201,
					"content": "ん？どれどれ、<color=#00E1FFFF>モラミート</color>、<color=#00E1FFFF>バターチキン</color>、<color=#00E1FFFF>「お肉ツミツミ」</color>…どれを選んだのか…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "ハティム"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2300103,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2300103
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2300103",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2300103,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"ハティム"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230010301,
					"content": "おぉ、この匂い…これは間違いなく金運の香り！黄金のオーラだ！今回は大儲けできそうだぞ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230010302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "ハティム"
				},
				{
					"id": 230010302,
					"content": "恩に着るよ。これから「蓄財の地」に行って、この「千金料理」を食べてくる。では、吉報を待っていてくれ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230010303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "ハティム"
				},
				{
					"id": 230010303,
					"content": "「蓄財の地」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230010304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230010304,
					"content": "「千金料理」と同じ、俺の金儲けの秘訣だ。いわゆる、金運のパワースポットだな。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230010305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "ハティム"
				},
				{
					"id": 230010305,
					"content": "例えばあの城門。日々、無数の商人が金を持って行き交うんだ…金運がいいに決まってる！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230010306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "ハティム"
				},
				{
					"id": 230010306,
